  <entry>
    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/123456789/v1.4.0</id>
    <updated>2026-10-26T12:30:00Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/example/agent-cli/releases/tag/v1.4.0"/>
    <title>v1.4.0 &#8212; background agents</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;New features&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agents can now keep working in the &lt;strong&gt;background&lt;/strong&gt; while you edit; check on them with &lt;code&gt;/tasks&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MCP servers can be restarted from the status bar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Fixes&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed a crash when a diff contained CRLF line endings &amp;amp; tabs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full changelog: &lt;a href="https://github.com/example/agent-cli/compare/v1.3.2...v1.4.0"&gt;v1.3.2...v1.4.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content>
    <author>
      <name>maintainer</name>
    </author>
